<title>USA: Carlisle Cos sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Carlisle Cos sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>SYRACUSE, N.Y. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carlisle Cos Inc said on Wednesday its board of directors had approved a two-for-one split of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that the increase was subject to shareholder approval. A vote is expected before the end of 1996.</p>
<p>The diversified manufacturing company has about 15.1 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk, (212) 859-1610</p>
</text>
